.TH CSTR_RESET 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_reset \- clear all the characters and shrink the capacity to the minimum
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cstring.h>

cstr_reset(s);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
This macro is a pass-through wrapper for cstring_reset().
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s   cstr to reset
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_reset (3),
.BR cstr_set (3)
